docs/infra.md:14:The landing page (`SiteWorker`, ADR 0020) uses the stage's own name without `app` or `submit`: `pr-<n>.surveybeat.app` and `staging.surveybeat.app`. `production` serves it on workers.dev until the apex cutover below, and every other stage stays on workers.dev. On a stage without an `app` hostname (personal `dev-*` stages), the page's sign-in links (`/app`) cannot know the app's workers.dev URL and lead back to the landing page; open `mainUrl` from the deploy output instead.
